# The Home Assistant app's direct dependencies: the core dependencies in
# pyproject.toml, pinned. tests/test_packaging_extras.py fails if the two sets
# drift. requirements-headless.txt is compiled from this file with hashes for
# every package, including transitive ones, so each user's image build installs
# exactly what CI built:
#
#   pip-compile --generate-hashes --allow-unsafe --strip-extras requirements-headless.in
#
# Run it on Linux with Python 3.12, the image's platform.
